{
  "comment": "What script mods depend on and how ModDrop V finds it in a game folder. files: game-relative paths that show it is installed (the first is where it goes); assemblies: .NET assembly names it provides, each at <home>/<name>.dll; imports: native DLL names an .asi imports; namespaces: C# / VB namespaces a source script uses; editions: yes | early | no; bundle: a folder under data/dependencies ModDrop V can install it from (only for licences that allow it).",
